Models / pretrained weights (not distributed with KeyPrism; downloaded
at first run to ~/.keyprism/models/demucs/)
------------------------------------------------------------------
Demucs code (facebookresearch/demucs)  MIT
htdemucs ONNX exports (e.g. smank/htdemucs-onnx, the default
auto-download source) — third-party conversions of the MIT Demucs
model; conversion repos do not always restate a license.
